            "description_html": "<b>Laurey Satin Nickel Tribeca Cabinet Bar Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Tribeca Bar Pull has a Satin Nickel finish to perfectly match the modern appeal. The  Tribeca Bar Cabinet Pull is available in many sizes. Each cabinet handle comes packaged with the mounting screws. The Laurey Satin Nickel Tribeca Cabinet Bar Pull will add a modern look to your kitchen cabinets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Laurey Tribeca Satin Nickel Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Nickel</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-Tribeca-Sizes.jpg?v=1704354638\" width=\"380\" height=\"268\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"LAU-Tribeca\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>87801:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3.78\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4.762\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1.38\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 0.55\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>87802:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5.04\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6.02\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1.38\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 0.55\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>87803:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 7.56\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8.54\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1.38\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 0.55\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>87804:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 10.08\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11.06\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1.38\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 0.55\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>87805:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 12.60\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13.58\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1.38\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 0.55\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
